# EV-18 (Q2): seeds carry pinned sha256 treeDigests verified at every load.
# A CRLF-normalizing checkout would change the digested bytes, so every text
# file under council/ is forced to LF in a fresh checkout — `* text=auto
# eol=lf`. All seed files are text (verified on EV-18: no binaries, no
# symlinks), so no tighter text-only globs are needed.
* text=auto eol=lf